# xsnap.app — project rules

## What this is
xsnap.app = anonymous, text-only, public pastebin for CLI session
transcripts. Public pages carry a two-hop rendering (ANY → suomi → te reo
Māori) produced entirely CLIENT-side. The verbatim original is recoverable
only with the uploader's rinnegan. Provenance is never rendered publicly.

## Two publish modes
- Ciphertext (CLI): rinnegan `user:hash` at upload; original AES-256-GCM'd
  on xsnap; unlock via `/api/decrypt`.
- Plugin (AI sessions, keyless): session translates locally (both hops),
  plugin pushes the original to the uploader's PRIVATE GitHub repo and
  publishes only the Māori body. The rinnegan for unlock is the GitHub
  `user:pass` (PAT). Guidance: `plugin/AGENT.md`.

## Stack (zero npm dependencies — do not add any without operator approval)
- `worker/` — TypeScript fetch-handler app. Cloudflare Workers + D1 in
  prod; Bun + `bun:sqlite` locally via `dev/server.ts`.
- `cli/` — zero-dep Node/Bun CLI + local two-hop renderer
  (`cli/translate.js`) + QUIC-first transport with AdGuard-CA pinning.
- `plugin/` — keyless session plugin shipped with the rinnegan'd
  ufo-fsd.kimi.pro section.

## Hard invariants
1. Translation is ALWAYS local, two hops: ANY language → suomi → Māori.
   NEVER translate server-side; NEVER target input languages with
   server corpora. Unknown tokens pass through unchanged.
2. Public paste pages: text-only, no JS, no uploader identity, no
   `user@host` tokens (scrubbed to `koreingoa@tūmau`), no GitHub repo
   coordinates, canonical + robots + sitemap, immutable cache.
3. Unlock requires an ownership-proving key (rinnegan hash match, or
   GitHub creds whose login owns the paste). Credentials are
   request-scoped — never logged, never stored.
4. `/p/*/unlock` is the only scripted page (noindex); all other pages CSP
   `default-src 'none'`.
5. No per-user data on any public response, ever.

## Commands
- Local run: `bun dev/server.ts` (port 8787, SQLite `dev/xsnap.db`)
- Regression: `bash test/smoke.sh` (both modes, hop lockstep, leaks)
- CLI: `node cli/xsnap.js upload -whole -f s.log -r <user:hash> --api http://localhost:8787`
- Dev rinnegan: `curl -s -X POST localhost:8787/dev/rinnegan -d '{"user":"alice"}'`
- Deploy: see `docs/DEPLOY.md` (dedicated worker `xsnap-paste`; NEVER the
  shared `xsnapshot` Cloudflare Pages project)

## Path map (authoritative: docs/PATHS.md)
- Route change → `worker/index.ts`
- Corpora / local hops → `cli/translate.js` (hop-1 values must have hop-2
  entries — smoke enforces)
- Rinnegan spec/verify → `worker/rinnegan.ts` + `docs/RINNEGAN.md`
- Unlock dialog (XP) → `worker/html.ts` `unlockPage()`
- Plugin plumbing → `plugin/xsnap.mjs`; agent guidance → `plugin/AGENT.md`
- Transcript slicing → `cli/transcript.js`
- QUIC/CA transport → `cli/transport.js`
- D1 schema → `schema.sql`
